OL,3,GNEWSAIsland gets huge water supply
OL,4,Aboost from storm
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn island notorious for water shortages
OL,7,Fhas captured more than 100,000 litres
OL,8,Fof rain in 48 hours thanks to Storm
OL,9,FAusten.
OL,11,FLundy Island, located in the Bristol
OL,12,FChannel off the north Devon coast, is
OL,13,Fentirely self-sufficient and relies on
OL,14,Fa combination of rainwater and
OL,15,Fboreholes drilled into the granite for
OL,16,Fsupplies.
OL,18,FBut the hottest and driest summer on
OL,19,Frecord saw reservoir levels drop as low
OL,20,Fas 13% earlier this year, forcing the
OL,21,Femergency shipments of water from the
OL,22,Fmainland.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
